OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a frosty start most areas
OL,6,Fwill stay dry with some good spells of
OL,7,Fsunshine. Parts of Aberdeenshire could
OL,8,Fhave the odd light shower this
OL,9,Fmorning. A little less cold.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry evening and night with
OL,12,Fsome long clear periods. Frost will
OL,13,Fdevelop and will become moderate to
OL,14,Fsevere in sheltered spots in the west.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FAnother dry and bright day
OL,17,Fwith some long sunny spells. Rather
OL,18,Fcold with frost early and late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
