OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,6,Fspreading east on Tuesday with snow on
OL,7,Fhigher ground for a time. Rain
OL,8,Flingering into Wednesday, dying out
OL,9,Flater then mainly dry on Thursday.
